1
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:22,530
Zhijiang Rongliang Wuxian Technology (Zhejiang) Co., Ltd. Zhejiang Yanhe Culture Technology Co., Ltd.

2
00:01:10,960 --> 00:01:12,690
This is the official document.

3
00:01:13,280 --> 00:01:15,160
We suspect you killed Musician Han

4
00:01:15,160 --> 00:01:17,039
and his senior disciple Cui Yujing.

5
00:01:17,039 --> 00:01:18,570
We're here to investigate.

6
00:01:20,800 --> 00:01:22,320
You still won't give up.

7
00:01:22,440 --> 00:01:23,840
Feel free to look around.

8
00:01:38,880 --> 00:01:40,140
Two great detectives,

9
00:01:40,160 --> 00:01:41,320
did you find

10
00:01:41,600 --> 00:01:42,600
Gu insects,

11
00:01:42,880 --> 00:01:43,940
medicinal powder,

12
00:01:44,280 --> 00:01:45,680
or other murder weapons?

13
00:02:01,520 --> 00:02:02,560
There is nothing.

14
00:02:44,880 --> 00:02:46,079
That should be right.

15
00:02:46,880 --> 00:02:48,400
You memorized it so fast.

16
00:02:49,640 --> 00:02:50,120
Look.

17
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:52,480
This is the score for 'Nanshan Youtai'.

18
00:02:52,480 --> 00:02:53,540
The Shang note here

19
00:02:53,880 --> 00:02:55,600
has been changed to the Yu note,

20
00:02:55,600 --> 00:02:57,280
and the rhythm is half a beat slower.

21
00:02:57,280 --> 00:02:58,840
This seemingly minor adjustment

22
00:02:58,840 --> 00:03:01,640
perfectly matches the evil melody 'Chonggu Yao'.

23
00:03:02,200 --> 00:03:03,730
I'll go catch him right now.

24
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:04,920
Wait.

25
00:03:06,320 --> 00:03:07,240
Ashina Xiao

26
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:08,160
didn't have any prior contact

27
00:03:08,160 --> 00:03:09,400
with the deceased.

28
00:03:09,760 --> 00:03:11,560
Someone else did the poisoning.

29
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:13,520
The person in this lute academy

30
00:03:13,520 --> 00:03:14,720
who helped him poison

31
00:03:14,720 --> 00:03:16,160
and alter the score

32
00:03:16,320 --> 00:03:17,650
is the real mastermind.

33
00:03:17,960 --> 00:03:19,560
We need to play the long game,

34
00:03:19,760 --> 00:03:21,160
so don't alert the enemy.

35
00:03:23,440 --> 00:03:24,700
You have a smart brain.

36
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:25,920
So smart.

37
00:03:28,200 --> 00:03:29,240
He's back.

38
00:03:29,440 --> 00:03:30,880
Help!

39
00:03:30,880 --> 00:03:31,810
There's a ghost!

40
00:03:32,160 --> 00:03:32,720
Help!

41
00:03:33,440 --> 00:03:34,370
There's a ghost!

42
00:03:34,920 --> 00:03:35,880
He's back.

43
00:03:36,600 --> 00:03:38,320
Help!

44
00:03:38,320 --> 00:03:39,850
He's back! There's a ghost!

45
00:03:41,160 --> 00:03:41,880
Help!

46
00:03:41,880 --> 00:03:42,920
There's a ghost!

47
00:03:47,040 --> 00:03:47,720
I was wrong.

48
00:03:47,720 --> 00:03:48,680
Spare me!

49
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:49,560
I was wrong.

50
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:57,680
What's wrong with you?

51
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:58,560
What's wrong with you?

52
00:03:58,560 --> 00:03:59,520
I'm young and ignorant.

53
00:03:59,520 --> 00:04:01,240
Don't kill me. I know I was wrong.

54
00:04:01,240 --> 00:04:02,280
Make him stop.

55
00:04:03,400 --> 00:04:04,000
Stop!

56
00:04:05,400 --> 00:04:06,160
Stop!

57
00:04:06,920 --> 00:04:07,720
Spare me!

58
00:04:08,120 --> 00:04:08,850
Are you okay?

59
00:04:30,400 --> 00:04:31,080
Lord Su.

60
00:04:33,400 --> 00:04:34,260
What happened?

61
00:04:34,640 --> 00:04:35,720
We were on duty last night,

62
00:04:35,720 --> 00:04:37,120
and heard someone calling for help.

63
00:04:37,120 --> 00:04:38,120
And then we saw...

64
00:04:38,440 --> 00:04:40,170
a dark figure playing a zither.

65
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:41,700
The sound of it killed him.

66
00:04:42,640 --> 00:04:43,770
Is that yellow wine?

67
00:04:56,240 --> 00:04:57,640
It's the Jiuyin Gu again.

68
00:04:58,400 --> 00:04:59,280
What about Ashina Xiao?

69
00:04:59,280 --> 00:05:00,400
Following your orders,

70
00:05:00,400 --> 00:05:01,160
our men

71
00:05:01,160 --> 00:05:02,760
kept an eye on Ashina Xiao all night.

72
00:05:02,760 --> 00:05:04,080
He never left the inn.

73
00:05:04,320 --> 00:05:05,450
Then who could it be?

74
00:05:05,640 --> 00:05:06,240
Oh, right.

75
00:05:06,640 --> 00:05:07,500
Before he died,

76
00:05:07,760 --> 00:05:08,920
he kept saying...

77
00:05:10,760 --> 00:05:11,920
I was still young then.

78
00:05:11,920 --> 00:05:14,080
I didn't know any better.

79
00:05:14,080 --> 00:05:16,040
Spare me!

80
00:05:16,720 --> 00:05:17,980
He kept shouting this.

81
00:05:18,640 --> 00:05:19,240
Lord Su,

82
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:20,560
it sounds like

83
00:05:20,560 --> 00:05:22,160
he was talking to his classmate.

84
00:05:22,160 --> 00:05:23,360
Did they do something wrong

85
00:05:23,360 --> 00:05:24,400
to him back then?

86
00:05:24,960 --> 00:05:25,820
Could it be that

87
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:27,760
Chu Feng has returned?

88
00:05:29,800 --> 00:05:30,680
Ghosts killing people?

89
00:05:30,680 --> 00:05:32,159
Don't let your imagination run wild.

90
00:05:32,159 --> 00:05:33,420
Chu Feng died long ago.

91
00:05:33,720 --> 00:05:35,520
There's no such thing as ghosts.

92
00:05:36,960 --> 00:05:38,280
There were two of you.

93
00:05:38,720 --> 00:05:39,880
How could you not even catch

94
00:05:39,880 --> 00:05:40,760
a shadow playing the zither?

95
00:05:40,760 --> 00:05:42,520
Although I didn't catch the shadow,

96
00:05:42,520 --> 00:05:44,520
I cut this off from him.

97
00:05:49,960 --> 00:05:51,040
This is silk.

98
00:05:52,640 --> 00:05:53,880
According to the laws of the Tang Dynasty,

99
00:05:53,880 --> 00:05:55,960
only officials of the third rank and above can wear silk.

100
00:05:55,960 --> 00:05:57,159
Oh my.

101
00:05:57,400 --> 00:05:59,659
Our magistrate is only of the sixth rank.

102
00:06:00,440 --> 00:06:01,770
Prince Ling's Mansion.

103
00:06:07,760 --> 00:06:09,560
We are ordered to investigate the murders

104
00:06:09,560 --> 00:06:11,040
of Cui Yujing and Musician Han.

105
00:06:11,040 --> 00:06:12,240
I would like to ask you

106
00:06:12,360 --> 00:06:13,960
to help identify something.

107
00:06:16,400 --> 00:06:17,280
This fabric

108
00:06:17,640 --> 00:06:19,170
belongs to the royal court.

109
00:06:19,520 --> 00:06:22,600
The material, pattern, and style all match.

110
00:06:22,760 --> 00:06:24,080
May I ask, Princess,

111
00:06:24,280 --> 00:06:25,520
have any stewards or servants gone missing

112
00:06:25,520 --> 00:06:28,400
from your mansion recently?

113
00:06:29,280 --> 00:06:30,280
Or

114
00:06:30,560 --> 00:06:31,840
are any items missing?

115
00:06:33,240 --> 00:06:33,960
No.

116
00:06:37,720 --> 00:06:39,250
I haven't seen Prince Ling.

117
00:06:41,520 --> 00:06:42,920
Prince Ling is very busy.

118
00:06:43,280 --> 00:06:44,920
Even your magistrate has to report in advance

119
00:06:44,920 --> 00:06:46,159
if he wants to see him.

120
00:06:46,520 --> 00:06:48,400
So you won't be able to see him.

121
00:06:50,600 --> 00:06:52,000
Does Lord Su suspect

122
00:06:52,159 --> 00:06:53,560
that last night's murder

123
00:06:54,400 --> 00:06:56,200
is related to Prince Ling's Mansion?

124
00:06:56,200 --> 00:06:58,930
You know about last night's incident, Princess?

125
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:00,330
Fangzhou is only so big.

126
00:07:00,760 --> 00:07:03,490
News of someone dying on the street spreads fast.

127
00:07:03,760 --> 00:07:04,520
Lord Su,

128
00:07:04,840 --> 00:07:07,700
this fabric is indeed rare among the common people,

129
00:07:07,840 --> 00:07:10,520
but it is common in our court.

130
00:07:11,080 --> 00:07:12,840
There are so many royal mansions in the Tang Dynasty.

131
00:07:12,840 --> 00:07:13,880
How can you be sure

132
00:07:14,200 --> 00:07:16,400
that this fabric is from Prince Ling's Mansion?

133
00:07:16,400 --> 00:07:18,600
I would like to look around the mansion,

134
00:07:18,840 --> 00:07:19,600
if I may?

135
00:07:20,160 --> 00:07:20,880
Of course.

136
00:07:27,840 --> 00:07:28,640
Lord Su,

137
00:07:28,640 --> 00:07:29,560
this is the record of all fabric purchases

138
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:31,020
in Prince Ling's Mansion.

139
00:07:38,600 --> 00:07:40,240
Indeed, nothing is missing.

140
00:08:09,280 --> 00:08:09,840
Look.

141
00:08:10,440 --> 00:08:12,640
This guy likes reading as much as you do.

142
00:08:13,640 --> 00:08:14,240
Indeed.

143
00:08:20,400 --> 00:08:20,960
See?

144
00:08:21,440 --> 00:08:22,520
I told you this has nothing to do

145
00:08:22,520 --> 00:08:23,520
with Prince Ling.

146
00:08:24,200 --> 00:08:25,200
Not necessarily.

147
00:08:26,400 --> 00:08:28,760
I noticed that many books in the study

148
00:08:29,280 --> 00:08:31,280
are on parchment from the Western Regions.

149
00:08:31,280 --> 00:08:33,409
Is there anything strange about that?

150
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:36,919
Prince Ling was originally the Crown Prince,

151
00:08:36,919 --> 00:08:38,520
but was demoted to Fangzhou.

152
00:08:38,679 --> 00:08:40,760
Do you think he harbors resentment?

153
00:08:41,280 --> 00:08:42,520
Does he have a motive

154
00:08:42,520 --> 00:08:44,520
to use the Zither Demon and Gu poison

155
00:08:45,040 --> 00:08:46,360
to cause chaos in Fangzhou

156
00:08:46,360 --> 00:08:47,360
and take revenge on the imperial court?

157
00:08:47,360 --> 00:08:49,440
I think Prince Ling is a nice person.

158
00:08:50,040 --> 00:08:51,300
Are you overthinking?

159
00:08:51,640 --> 00:08:52,500
Think about it.

160
00:08:53,320 --> 00:08:56,000
Prince Ling was just demoted to Fangzhou not long ago,

161
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:57,880
and now strange cases are happening one after another here.

162
00:08:57,880 --> 00:08:59,940
Although the cases are independent,

163
00:09:00,280 --> 00:09:01,810
there might be a conspiracy

164
00:09:02,200 --> 00:09:04,660
that we don't know about hidden within them.

165
00:09:04,920 --> 00:09:06,720
What conspiracy could Prince Ling possibly have?

166
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:07,520
I don't know.

167
00:09:07,720 --> 00:09:08,800
I'm just guessing.

168
00:09:12,240 --> 00:09:13,880
Your Highness has been staying up late a lot recently.

169
00:09:13,880 --> 00:09:15,680
Have some snow fungus porridge.

170
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:17,600
Princess,

171
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:19,640
are you sure this piece of fabric

172
00:09:19,640 --> 00:09:20,970
is not from our mansion?

173
00:09:21,440 --> 00:09:23,760
I checked the recent entry and exit records of Fangzhou,

174
00:09:23,760 --> 00:09:25,240
and there is no one from Chang'an.

175
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:26,280
This fabric

176
00:09:26,760 --> 00:09:28,880
indeed comes from the Prince Ling Mansion.

177
00:09:28,880 --> 00:09:29,400
What?

178
00:09:30,400 --> 00:09:31,460
Then why didn't you

179
00:09:31,520 --> 00:09:32,280
tell Su Yao?

180
00:09:32,960 --> 00:09:34,240
This concerns a murder case.

181
00:09:34,240 --> 00:09:35,240
How could I say it?

182
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:36,690
Don't forget

183
00:09:37,040 --> 00:09:38,880
that so many people in Chang'an have their eyes on you.

184
00:09:38,880 --> 00:09:39,880
If someone finds out

185
00:09:39,880 --> 00:09:41,010
and causes trouble,

186
00:09:41,160 --> 00:09:42,120
what will we do?

187
00:09:44,960 --> 00:09:46,560
Your Highness, don't worry.

188
00:09:47,280 --> 00:09:48,480
Let me solve the case.

189
00:09:50,520 --> 00:09:51,240
You

190
00:09:51,480 --> 00:09:52,400
can solve cases?

191
00:09:52,400 --> 00:09:54,080
Do you remember a few years ago

192
00:09:54,680 --> 00:09:56,140
at your birthday banquet,

193
00:09:56,200 --> 00:09:58,330
some court musicians came to perform?

194
00:09:58,680 --> 00:10:00,440
You were so impressed at the time

195
00:10:00,440 --> 00:10:01,840
that you rewarded each musician

196
00:10:01,840 --> 00:10:03,880
with a bolt of ice silk brocade.

197
00:10:04,400 --> 00:10:05,280
Well,

198
00:10:05,960 --> 00:10:07,620
I really don't remember that.

199
00:10:07,760 --> 00:10:10,840
This is the roster of the musicians you rewarded back then.

200
00:10:10,840 --> 00:10:12,040
I remember that year,

201
00:10:12,160 --> 00:10:14,360
the male musicians received navy blue,

202
00:10:14,560 --> 00:10:17,090
and the female musicians received ink black.

203
00:10:17,200 --> 00:10:18,260
Female musicians?

204
00:10:19,400 --> 00:10:21,720
There were only two female musicians at the time.

205
00:10:21,720 --> 00:10:24,200
One was a pipa player from Liangzhou,

206
00:10:24,520 --> 00:10:25,400
and the other

207
00:10:25,400 --> 00:10:28,130
was a guqin player from the Chang'an Qin Academy.

208
00:10:28,360 --> 00:10:29,160
It's her,

209
00:10:29,520 --> 00:10:30,280
Chu Xiaoxiao.
